  "body": "Can multiple async operations be pending for WritableFileStream?  I presume so.\r\nIf so, what happens to following operations if one has an error? (Right now I presume nothing happens to them; they run as normal.)\r\nWe could, for example, abort all queued tasks for the stream on error.",
